1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 16]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:05,180
Master Zhang,

4
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:08,540
who did you come here to find?

5
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:11,170
An old friend named Wu Laogou.

6
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,500
Do you know him?

7
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,540
You don't know Wu Laogou,

8
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,780
the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

9
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,340
Who is Wu Laogou?

10
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,450
Is he so important

11
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:24,980
that you had to bring the army?

12
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:26,780
My friend,

13
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,780
you've asked the right man.

14
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:31,570
Of everyone in the Mystic Nine,

15
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:33,980
I'm closest to Laogou.

16
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,380
When it comes to his past,

17
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:38,570
only I can tell the tale.

18
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:45,260
He may not compare to Master Zhang,

19
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,980
but he's a legend in his own right.

20
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,100
To understand who he is,

21
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:52,220
we must begin with how he joined the Mystic Nine.

22
00:03:04,250 --> 00:03:05,460
Move it!

23
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:06,920
[Xiangyuan Mine]
- Hurry up! - You fool!

24
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:09,290
Laogou was sold into the mines as a boy,

25
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:11,500
where he lived a life worse than death.

26
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:26,850
Move!

27
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:28,410
Put your back into it!

28
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:30,220
Hurry!

29
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,940
Stop dawdling!

30
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,010
Move!

31
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,610
Hurry!

32
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:35,850
Go.

33
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,290
Hurry!

34
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,100
Catch it.

35
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:44,450
Stop slacking! Move!

36
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:46,500
Move faster!

37
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:48,260
Hurry!

38
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,100
- Come on! - Move!

39
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:50,170
Did you hear me?

40
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,890
- Go! - Hurry!

41
00:03:52,910 --> 00:03:54,340
Why are you so slow?

42
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,850
Move! Get over there!

43
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:02,060
Hurry!

44
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,220
Stop dawdling! Move!

45
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,890
Hurry!

46
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:05,780
Move!

47
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,540
Hurry!

48
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:10,610
You in the back, move.

49
00:04:16,110 --> 00:04:16,920
What are you staring at?

50
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,020
What are you doing?

51
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,050
Leave him!

52
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:20,780
- Don't mind him! - Move!

53
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:21,610
Eat your food!

54
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,780
- Keep the line moving!
- Get back to work when you're done!

55
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:24,660
Eat faster!

56
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,460
Stop dawdling!

57
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,140
I'm talking to you!

58
00:04:26,250 --> 00:04:27,140
Worthless wretch.

59
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,140
Why are you dawdling? Hurry!

60
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:29,900
Eat faster!

61
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:31,660
Hurry up and eat!

62
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:33,020
Master Zhang later rescued him.

63
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:33,810
Get back to work when you're done!

64
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:35,700
From then on, he placed his faith in the Mystic Nine,

65
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,870
- hoping they would
- Thank you, Master Zhang.

66
00:04:36,870 --> 00:04:38,660
- uphold justice.
- Thank you for saving us.

67
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,980
Thank you, Master Zhang.

68
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,050
Zhang Qishan.

69
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:47,020
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

70
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:50,730
Stop dawdling.

71
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,730
Move! Slacking off, are you?

72
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,340
But not everyone was as fortunate as Laogou.

73
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,290
See?

74
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,610
Remember this, all of you.

75
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:18,610
This is what happens to shirkers and malingerers!

76
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:22,170
People only learn the hard way.

77
00:05:23,270 --> 00:05:25,540
A beating stays with them longer than a meal!

78
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:32,170
Halt.

79
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:35,510
[Zhang's Residence]

80
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,140
What do you want?

81
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,100
My friend,

82
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,020
this is the Zhang residence, right?

83
00:05:40,830 --> 00:05:41,780
I'm here to see Master Zhang.

84
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:44,460
The Changsha Defense Commander doesn't meet just anyone.

85
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,410
No, my friend.

86
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,850
I have an extremely urgent matter for him.

87
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,220
Please,

88
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,540
tell him I'm here.

89
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,810
Then you can wait.

90
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:55,700
For how long?

91
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,460
At least a few months.

92
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,460
A few months?

93
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:03,810
Out! Ninth Master isn't here!

94
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,540
Out! Go!

95
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,220
Ninth Master isn't in Changsha.

96
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,980
Come back when he returns.

97
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:08,850
Now leave!

98
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:14,740
[Xie's Residence]

99
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:22,660
[Pear Garden]

100
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:26,100
[Pear Garden]

101
00:06:28,830 --> 00:06:37,930
♪The Monkey King, born of nature, takes countless forms♪

102
00:06:38,630 --> 00:06:42,340
♪He steals pills and wine♪

103
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:46,930
- Bravo! - Bravo!

104
00:06:51,190 --> 00:07:01,170
♪For throwing the Peach Banquet into chaos♪

105
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:10,540
♪He's hunted by 100,000 heavenly troops♪

106
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:15,900
- Bravo! - Bravo!

107
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:24,290
What are you doing?

108
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,700
I'm here to see Second Master Hong.

109
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,170
I urgently need his help.

110
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,980
Many people want to see him.

111
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,490
Who are you?

112
00:07:32,950 --> 00:07:36,610
Second Master doesn't see just anyone.

113
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,370
Out!

114
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,220
My friend, I...

115
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:38,780
Get out!

116
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,660
Back then, Laogou went from door to door seeking help.

117
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:44,220
He sought out both Ninth Master and Second Master,

118
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,810
hoping to join the Mystic Nine and meet Master Zhang.

119
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,660
But he was

120
00:07:52,310 --> 00:07:53,930
only a young lad

121
00:07:54,390 --> 00:07:55,660
with neither status nor influence.

122
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:58,490
How could he possibly meet Master Zhang?

123
00:07:58,750 --> 00:07:59,250
Tiezui.

124
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,850
My friend, how was my story?

125
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,170
Very good.

126
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,810
I'll tell you the rest next time.

127
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:09,900
Next time, then.

128
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,340
Let's go.

129
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,130
Stay alert, everyone.

130
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,730
We're about to enter Mount Heimen.

131
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:48,700
From this moment on,

132
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,420
tread lightly.

133
00:08:51,150 --> 00:08:52,530
By local custom,

134
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:57,060
no one entering Mount Heimen may disturb the mountain deity.

135
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,130
Yes.

136
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:12,140
[Mount Heimen]

137
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:26,850
Master Zhang,

138
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:28,370
the feng shui here is ominous.

139
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,370
Everyone, be careful!

140
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:32,530
We're entering the mountain deity's domain.

141
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,300
Master Zhang.

142
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,130
There's something ahead.

143
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,010
Stay alert!

144
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,460
Master Zhang,

145
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,370
I saw that Nuo mask in the stockade.

146
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,100
That hunter

147
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,530
seems to be from Heimao Stockade.

148
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,770
Lower the body first.

149
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,490
His brains have been sucked dry.

150
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,890
Tiezui, what do you make of it?

151
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,180
The "Classic of the Northern Interior of the Realm" says:

152
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,220
"The Taoquan resembles a dog.

153
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,850
Blue-green, it eats people starting from the head.

154
00:10:58,750 --> 00:10:59,850
Qiongqi resembles a tiger.

155
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,180
Winged, it eats people starting from the head.

156
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:03,850
Its victims' hair hangs loose.

157
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,340
Another account says it eats them starting from the feet."

158
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,370
Master Zhang,

159
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:10,220
the classic says

160
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,250
both the Taoquan and Qiongqi

161
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,530
eat people starting from the head.

162
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,770
What do you mean?

163
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:19,980
Are you saying I ate him?

164
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:22,130
That's not what I meant.

165
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:26,180
Maybe a Taoquan ate him.

166
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:28,100
And

167
00:11:28,390 --> 00:11:29,890
"Strange Tales" records a creature

168
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,180
shaped like a wild dog

169
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:35,250
that feeds solely on human brains.

170
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,340
The body was dragged

171
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,340
all the way here from up there.

172
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:05,650
Master Zhang.

173
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,130
Master Zhang,

174
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:13,100
judging by these violent drag marks,

175
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,250
this creature must be immensely strong.

176
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,770
The mountain deity did this!

177
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:19,060
It must be nearby!

178
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:22,370
Tell me,

179
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,220
have you ever seen the mountain deity?

180
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:27,770
I've never seen it.

181
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,770
But the stories I heard as a child said

182
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,650
the mountain deity eats people's brains.

183
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,650
All right, enough.

184
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:35,820
Stop talking nonsense.

185
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:37,220
With so many of us here,

186
00:12:37,390 --> 00:12:38,420
even a tiger would be afraid.

187
00:12:38,910 --> 00:12:39,420
Besides,

188
00:12:40,150 --> 00:12:41,820
Master Zhang is here.

189
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:43,460
What creature would dare come near?

190
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:44,730
Nonsense.

191
00:12:45,390 --> 00:12:46,370
You have a point.

192
00:12:48,270 --> 00:12:48,940
Then let's do this.

193
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,300
We'll change our approach.

194
00:12:50,670 --> 00:12:52,820
Xiaoyu, let Tiezui walk alone

195
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,820
as bait.

196
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:55,130
We'll follow him.

197
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,610
Master Zhang,

198
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,770
you aren't gambling with my life, are you?

199
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,250
Put what we brought on him.

200
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,300
Yes.

201
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,100
What is it?

202
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,580
The Zhang Clan's secret weapon.

203
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:08,340
You're going to love it.

204
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:09,490
Master Zhang,

205
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:12,250
my plain clothes are perfectly fine.

206
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,420
There's no need to put me in...

207
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,770
Don't worry. I'm here.

208
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,650
That's not the point, Master Zhang...

209
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:17,650
Can't you divine the future?

210
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:19,370
Work it out yourself.

211
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:23,460
Right. You have a point.

212
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,460
Master Zhang,

213
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:26,490
this infant...

214
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:28,300
He hardly ever cries.

215
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,460
He'll grow up to be extraordinary.

216
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:31,940
Keep him safe.

217
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:33,730
Have everyone get ready.

218
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:34,940
Yes.

219
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:58,940
I've checked the whole area.

220
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:02,250
Many of the leaves are covered in this slime.

221
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:05,610
That means

222
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:08,180
the mountain deity often prowls around here.

223
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:10,850
It usually appears at night.

224
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,940
We cannot kill it.

225
00:14:15,510 --> 00:14:16,730
We can only take you this far.

226
00:14:17,670 --> 00:14:18,300
Strangers,

227
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,490
good luck.

228
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,100
Tiezui.

229
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:43,250
Everything's ready.

230
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:58,490
Master Zhang.

231
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:02,370
Master Zhang?

232
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,890
Are you there?

233
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:07,300
If you are, say something.

234
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:16,610
Is anyone there?

235
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,300
This isn't funny.

236
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:20,220
I could get killed.

237
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,220
If you're there,

238
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:23,940
throw a pebble

239
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,130
or make a sound.

240
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,420
Adjutant Xiaoyu?

241
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:40,980
Master Zhang?

242
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:44,340
I'm my family's only heir.

243
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:46,490
You can't let me die here.

244
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,010
Master...

245
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:17,370
Adjutant Xiaoyu,

246
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:19,100
is that you?

247
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:51,490
Master Zhang!

248
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:54,130
I knew you wouldn't leave me here alone.

249
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,140
What is this?

250
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:16,460
Human skin?

251
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,530
It was torn from that monster.

252
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,250
Master Zhang.

253
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,700
We failed to stop it at the perimeter.

254
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:27,490
The monster got away.

255
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:28,980
Master Zhang,

256
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:31,900
could that monster be the mountain deity?

257
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,420
Probably not.

258
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,010
We made inquiries in Heimao Stockade.

259
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,810
Legend says the mountain deity there

260
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,570
is enormous, as large as an elephant.

261
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:43,700
But the creature we saw

262
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:46,460
was only about as tall as a man.

263
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:49,460
But this skin reeks.

264
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,490
It smells like a giant salamander.

265
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,050
It has a human form, yet smells like a giant salamander?

266
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:55,770
How could something like this

267
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,180
exist deep in the mountains?

268
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:00,050
Master Zhang,

269
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:02,330
do you think there might be

270
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:03,860
a tribe of strange humanoids living here?

271
00:18:04,110 --> 00:18:05,090
We have too few clues.

272
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:06,140
Don't make wild guesses.

273
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:08,810
Everyone, stay on high alert.

274
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,700
The situation here is more complicated than I expected.

275
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:14,250
We'll camp here tonight.

276
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,250
Adjutant.

277
00:18:20,550 --> 00:18:21,090
Adjutant!

278
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:23,810
Where's Stinky Yu?

279
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:25,330
Everyone, follow me!

280
00:18:25,590 --> 00:18:26,180
Yes, sir!

281
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,290
Master Zhang!

282
00:18:30,070 --> 00:18:30,700
Master Zhang!

283
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:32,810
You're

284
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,980
leaving me behind again?

285
00:19:12,070 --> 00:19:12,700
Everyone,

286
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:13,900
follow me.

287
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:54,180
Someone's coming after us.

288
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,570
Is that the mountain deity?

289
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:22,860
Our mission

290
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,330
is to kill the Japanese.

291
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,420
Good heavens.

292
00:20:59,510 --> 00:21:00,700
A tooth this big?

293
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:05,090
That's not right.

294
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:07,770
Adjutant Zhang?

295
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:10,770
Adjutant Zhang?

296
00:22:20,750 --> 00:22:21,420
Adjutant Zhang.

297
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:22,530
Adjutant Zhang!

298
00:22:23,110 --> 00:22:23,810
Adjutant Zhang!

299
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:27,090
Master Zhang, we found something.

300
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,620
Master Zhang, look.

301
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:39,490
Move.

302
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:28,250
Master Zhang,

303
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,570
Xiaoyu...

304
00:23:58,790 --> 00:23:59,290
Master Zhang?

305
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,380
He must have been resting below

306
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,220
and got dragged all the way up here.

307
00:24:04,110 --> 00:24:06,730
Was it the monster from earlier?

308
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:11,530
No.

309
00:24:12,550 --> 00:24:15,050
It was another one, much larger.

310
00:24:24,920 --> 00:24:26,220
It went back the way we came.

311
00:24:29,510 --> 00:24:30,090
Tiezui.

312
00:24:33,550 --> 00:24:34,050
Eighth Master!

313
00:24:34,590 --> 00:24:35,140
Eighth Master!

314
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,220
Eighth Master.

315
00:24:37,200 --> 00:24:38,980
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

316
00:24:40,030 --> 00:24:40,570
Eighth Master.

317
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:43,730
- Eighth Master! - Eighth Master!

318
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:54,460
What is he laughing at?

319
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:10,940
Master Zhang,

320
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:14,090
what is that thing?

321
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:23,570
Master Zhang!

322
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,460
I... I'm Xiaoyu!

323
00:25:28,030 --> 00:25:30,810
Don't shoot!

324
00:25:31,790 --> 00:25:33,460
It really is the mountain deity!

325
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:37,250
Don't shoot!

326
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:37,810
After it!

327
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:38,730
Don't act rashly!

328
00:25:39,550 --> 00:25:40,380
Master Zhang, Xiaoyu...

329
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,660
It has Xiaoyu.

330
00:25:42,790 --> 00:25:43,940
We'll only get one chance.

331
00:25:52,070 --> 00:25:53,730
Take the others to find Eighth Master.

332
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:54,250
Yes.

333
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:55,140
Yancheng, Yantao,

334
00:25:55,310 --> 00:25:56,530
Zhang Xiaoli, Zhang Xiaoping,

335
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,940
load your weapons and follow me.

336
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,050
Yes.

337
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,980
Spread out. Find Eighth Master, quickly.

338
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:04,620
Yes.

339
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:07,050
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

340
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:07,980
Eighth Master!

341
00:26:08,550 --> 00:26:09,490
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

342
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:10,090
Xiaojin.

343
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:12,900
Eighth Master!

344
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:14,010
Xiaojin!

345
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:17,330
Xiaojin!

346
00:26:17,590 --> 00:26:18,180
Eighth Master?

347
00:26:18,830 --> 00:26:19,940
Is that you, Xiaojin?

348
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:20,490
Eighth Master.

349
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,860
I'm so scared, Xiaojin!

350
00:26:25,030 --> 00:26:25,690
What are you doing here?

351
00:26:25,690 --> 00:26:27,010
Xiaojin, that was so scary.

352
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:29,700
There was a monster just now, with feet this big.

353
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:31,250
Look, this is one of its teeth.

354
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:32,250
I nearly died of fright.

355
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:39,140
Eighth Master, we should go.

356
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:39,860
Something's wrong.

357
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:41,050
What happened?

358
00:26:41,270 --> 00:26:42,090
Adjutant Xiaoyu

359
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:44,250
was taken by a monster.

360
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:23,010
Help me restore worship of the mountain deity,

361
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:26,660
and I'll have someone from the stockade bring a baby

362
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,530
into the mountains with you.

363
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,220
This way.

364
00:27:52,310 --> 00:27:53,180
There's a trap ahead.

365
00:28:05,030 --> 00:28:06,250
Something is definitely wrong here.

366
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:09,460
If that thing appears,

367
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,620
I'll handle it.

368
00:28:11,880 --> 00:28:12,810
You rescue the adjutant.

369
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,090
If we really run into danger,

370
00:28:18,510 --> 00:28:19,700
hide the baby somewhere safe.

371
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:20,140
Yes.

372
00:28:39,110 --> 00:28:39,620
Wait.

373
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:41,290
What is it, Eighth Master?

374
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:42,660
Something is wrong here.

375
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:46,730
But Eighth Master,

376
00:28:47,310 --> 00:28:49,090
we need to rejoin Master Zhang at once.

377
00:28:55,120 --> 00:28:55,920
Eighth Master!

378
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:56,570
Adjutant Xiaojin,

379
00:28:57,750 --> 00:28:59,010
we should listen to Eighth Master.

380
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:05,420
Eighth Master.

381
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:08,860
This terrain forms a Coiled Dragon Pillar formation.

382
00:29:10,200 --> 00:29:13,140
The surrounding ridges resemble a dragon with its head pointing down.

383
00:29:14,110 --> 00:29:16,490
In feng shui, this is called a Condemned Dragon.

384
00:29:17,550 --> 00:29:18,140
Look.

385
00:29:18,790 --> 00:29:20,570
That forest is so heavily shrouded in mist

386
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,730
because it forms a maze

387
00:29:23,110 --> 00:29:24,730
that has trapped the dragon here.

388
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:29,420
There must be something here.

389
00:29:30,750 --> 00:29:32,530
Eighth Master, if something is here,

390
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:33,700
perhaps we should withdraw first.

391
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,490
No. Give me more time.

392
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:50,770
Eighth Master!

393
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:52,180
- Eighth Master! - Eighth Master.

394
00:30:08,830 --> 00:30:09,770
Where are my glasses?

395
00:30:10,790 --> 00:30:11,250
Eighth Master.

396
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:13,770
Are you all right?

397
00:30:14,110 --> 00:30:14,940
I'm fine.

398
00:30:17,110 --> 00:30:17,940
Here, get up.

399
00:30:18,550 --> 00:30:20,050
My poor backside...

400
00:30:33,070 --> 00:30:35,490
Where are we?

401
00:31:02,880 --> 00:31:04,460
Eighth Master, look.

402
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:26,180
There's a cliff here.

403
00:31:26,640 --> 00:31:27,290
Watch your step.

404
00:31:44,030 --> 00:31:44,730
This thing

405
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:46,490
looks ancient.

406
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:47,940
Eighth Master,

407
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,900
do you know what dynasty it's from?

408
00:31:50,510 --> 00:31:53,330
This chest appears to be made of rosewood.

409
00:31:57,510 --> 00:31:58,770
It dates to around the Han dynasty.

410
00:31:59,110 --> 00:32:00,490
It's remarkably well preserved.

411
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,730
It must have been sealed with wax

412
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:04,250
to protect it from decay and damp.

413
00:32:05,070 --> 00:32:07,420
But such rosewood chests

414
00:32:07,750 --> 00:32:09,730
came only as tribute from the southeastern tribes

415
00:32:09,830 --> 00:32:10,860
and were found among imperial gifts.

416
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:15,860
Why was this one abandoned here?

417
00:32:16,590 --> 00:32:17,620
If you don't know,

418
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:19,090
we certainly won't.

419
00:32:22,350 --> 00:32:23,290
I've never seen

420
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:24,700
this kind of vine either.

421
00:32:25,270 --> 00:32:25,980
Have you?

422
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:27,570
Never one this strange.

423
00:32:32,750 --> 00:32:33,330
Look here.

424
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:36,620
These holes in the chest

425
00:32:37,830 --> 00:32:40,250
seem to have been deliberately designed

426
00:32:40,830 --> 00:32:41,860
to leave space

427
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,860
for the vines to grow from within.

428
00:32:48,510 --> 00:32:49,620
So it's a potted plant?

429
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,770
It's a magical artifact chest, for goodness' sake.

430
00:32:56,350 --> 00:32:57,460
- This one? - Never mind.

431
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,220
The ancients placed it here

432
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:00,380
to practice magic

433
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,810
and cultivate immortality.

434
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,620
A chest this precious

435
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:08,940
must contain a rare magical artifact.

436
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:09,770
Come on.

437
00:33:11,270 --> 00:33:12,050
Open it.

438
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:14,660
Eighth Master, it may be dangerous.

439
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,220
Are we listening to you or me?

440
00:33:19,550 --> 00:33:20,090
Open it.

441
00:34:06,750 --> 00:34:08,050
What did you just do?

442
00:34:08,510 --> 00:34:10,260
It's a unique smoke technique of the Zhang Clan.

443
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:11,690
If the smoke is drawn inside,

444
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:13,610
it means there's a vast temperature difference within.

445
00:34:17,510 --> 00:34:18,980
If this is a coffin,

446
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,210
whatever is inside

447
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:23,420
must be a demon.

448
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:46,380
One.

449
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:47,380
Two.

450
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:48,300
Three.

451
00:35:04,710 --> 00:35:07,530
Why is there a jar inside the artifact chest?

452
00:35:08,710 --> 00:35:09,530
Look around it.

453
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,980
Those aren't ordinary tusks.

454
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:14,530
They're ancient tusks fossilized into dragon bone.

455
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:18,460
Eighth Master,

456
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:20,900
there seems to be something in the jar.

457
00:35:22,590 --> 00:35:23,380
Here. Take this.

458
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:30,090
It looks like a monkey.

459
00:35:30,150 --> 00:35:30,650
A monkey?

460
00:35:33,550 --> 00:35:34,650
Strange.

461
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:37,980
Why does its skin look so aged?

462
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:39,650
Could this be

463
00:35:42,030 --> 00:35:43,820
the Lifeswapping Herb?

464
00:35:44,670 --> 00:35:45,380
Lifeswapping Herb?

465
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,610
Ancient Xiangxi had a dark ritual:

466
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:50,570
a newborn animal

467
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:52,570
would be submerged in a jar of special liquid.

468
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:54,980
The corpse water from the jar

469
00:35:55,670 --> 00:35:56,740
would then be used to nourish this plant

470
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,650
called the Lifeswapping Herb.

471
00:35:59,070 --> 00:36:01,900
Legend says it can even transfer lifespans.

472
00:36:02,670 --> 00:36:03,460
How?

473
00:36:04,190 --> 00:36:06,690
I suppose it drains the animal's lifespan

474
00:36:07,150 --> 00:36:08,940
into itself.

475
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,460
Then the herb

476
00:36:11,190 --> 00:36:13,340
is transplanted into another person's body.

477
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:15,130
No wonder

478
00:36:16,510 --> 00:36:19,090
the monkey's skin looks so aged.

479
00:36:19,590 --> 00:36:22,130
But what does the Lifeswapping Herb

480
00:36:23,030 --> 00:36:23,980
have to do with the mountain deity?

481
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:25,860
How would I know?

482
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:27,460
This is dark magic.

483
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:30,420
To find out,

484
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:31,980
we'll have to take the jar out.

485
00:36:32,150 --> 00:36:32,690
Take it out!

486
00:36:36,110 --> 00:36:37,420
Is that all right, Eighth Master?

487
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:10,380
What if I fed this to Zhang Qishan?

488
00:37:13,070 --> 00:37:15,050
Perhaps then he'd do as I say.

489
00:37:22,360 --> 00:37:24,090
I wonder how they're doing.

490
00:37:25,710 --> 00:37:26,860
Other than Xiangu,

491
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:29,860
no one else in the Mystic Nine will come for me, will they?

492
00:37:55,710 --> 00:37:56,170
Look.

493
00:37:57,190 --> 00:37:58,130
This monster

494
00:37:58,280 --> 00:38:00,380
resembles the one we just encountered.

495
00:38:08,150 --> 00:38:08,980
I remember now.

496
00:38:09,710 --> 00:38:10,900
There's an old Xiangxi legend

497
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:13,900
about a local creature,

498
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,380
half human and half fish,

499
00:38:15,510 --> 00:38:17,490
that dwells underground and feeds on people.

500
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:21,690
The locals called it Zhainiangniang.

501
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:23,490
This is it.

502
00:38:23,630 --> 00:38:24,610
This is a Zhainiangniang?

503
00:38:26,190 --> 00:38:28,050
Why is it dragging a chest?

504
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,490
Look.

505
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,900
This forest is littered with bones.

506
00:38:34,590 --> 00:38:37,170
That means the forest is poisonous.

507
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:38,940
People can't enter it,

508
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,690
but a Zhainiangniang can.

509
00:38:41,510 --> 00:38:43,980
They must've hidden inside such a chest

510
00:38:44,550 --> 00:38:45,980
and had a Zhainiangniang drag them in.

511
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:48,740
Does hiding in the chest keep out the poison?

512
00:38:51,800 --> 00:38:53,490
According to the mural,

513
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:56,380
after eating the Lifeswapping Herb,

514
00:38:57,070 --> 00:38:58,300
a person can withstand the poison,

515
00:38:58,880 --> 00:38:59,490
but

516
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,700
they will age rapidly.

517
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:06,900
That's

518
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:11,300
how the legend of transferring lifespans arose.

519
00:39:12,590 --> 00:39:14,130
People cultivated the Lifeswapping Herb

520
00:39:14,570 --> 00:39:16,150
so they could enter this forest.

521
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:18,780
But why did they

522
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:19,780
want to enter it?

523
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:23,980
What's hidden in this forest?

524
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:39,530
Look.

525
00:39:40,230 --> 00:39:41,740
Isn't that the little golden jar

526
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:43,010
Stinky Yu mentioned?

527
00:39:43,190 --> 00:39:44,460
The one Ding Qiansui spat out.

528
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:46,530
So this is what they used

529
00:39:47,030 --> 00:39:48,490
to regain their youth.

530
00:39:51,620 --> 00:39:53,980
[Xumi Realm, Otherworld Cave]

531
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:58,090
Otherworld Cave?

532
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:02,260
Xumi Realm, Otherworld Cave?

533
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:05,490
All the believers who entered the tower

534
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:07,490
wanted to reach a place

535
00:40:08,070 --> 00:40:09,210
called the Xumi Realm.

536
00:40:11,510 --> 00:40:12,460
This cave

537
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:15,860
must be where the Otherworld Patriarch attained the Way.

538
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:19,570
I understand now.

539
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,900
The underground river beneath the Otherworld Tower

540
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,650
leads directly to the Otherworld Cave in Xiangxi.

541
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:27,490
The Otherworld Cave is the Xumi Realm,

542
00:40:27,650 --> 00:40:29,260
an earthly paradise.

543
00:40:30,710 --> 00:40:31,570
Then the Xumi Realm

544
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,130
must be in Xiangxi.

545
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,300
Enough!

546
00:42:03,590 --> 00:42:04,420
Put him down.

547
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:07,050
Why have you trespassed on my domain?

548
00:42:08,960 --> 00:42:10,050
Are you the mountain deity?

549
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:14,570
Do you eat people?

550
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:16,090
I...

551
00:42:17,030 --> 00:42:18,520
I need to eat...

552
00:42:18,570 --> 00:42:20,010
If you eat people, you die.

553
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:22,690
I don't want to die.

554
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:26,690
Even a deity fears death?

555
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:29,210
You killed so many of my men.

556
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:32,300
You don't get a choice today!

557
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:43,380
So you, too, are mortal.

558
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:57,690
KGX?

559
00:44:02,700 --> 00:44:05,700
[KGX-02-03]

560
00:44:06,510 --> 00:44:08,340
One of Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's test subjects.

561
00:44:26,030 --> 00:44:26,740
Laogou.

562
00:44:31,840 --> 00:44:32,690
Master Zhang!

563
00:44:34,230 --> 00:44:34,940
Master Zhang.

564
00:44:37,590 --> 00:44:38,260
Master Zhang,

565
00:44:38,360 --> 00:44:40,260
the mountain deity punished us.

566
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:42,650
They're all dead.

567
00:44:48,440 --> 00:44:49,170
Give me the binoculars.

568
00:44:53,960 --> 00:44:54,460
Oh, no.

569
00:44:57,000 --> 00:44:57,820
The Xumi Realm

570
00:44:58,360 --> 00:45:00,170
must be inside that miasma-filled forest.

571
00:45:05,880 --> 00:45:09,240
Legend says Mount Heimen is impassable because a mountain deity

572
00:45:09,590 --> 00:45:10,650
dwells there.

573
00:45:11,800 --> 00:45:14,650
But now it seems the deity isn't the reason.

574
00:45:15,150 --> 00:45:17,650
It's the highly poisonous miasma on Mount Heimen.

575
00:45:18,070 --> 00:45:18,740
Exactly.

576
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:21,860
In that case,

577
00:45:22,840 --> 00:45:23,690
we can't enter either.

578
00:45:27,280 --> 00:45:28,170
